---
description: Slide writing standards for markdown files in .slides
globs: .slides/**/*.{md,mdx,markdown,mdc}
alwaysApply: false
---

1. Header should never span more than 1 line.
2. Subheaders should succinctly describe the idea.
3. Use three or fewer bullets to present the topic.
4. If there is an author for a quote, you must **bold** their name.

NEVER put a colon (:) in the header, unless it has incredibly high impact.
NEVER use the em dash (—).

For tone and voice, check [AGENTS.md](.agents/AGENTS.md).